{
  "comment": [
    "Error codes for the agent / board / env-vault / routes / MCP / PR",
    "domain. Schema and rules: see 00-foundation.json — this file is one",
    "domain's slice of the same registry, split so parallel conversions",
    "do not serialize behind a single editor.",
    "",
    "Secret discipline, which this domain needs more than any other:",
    "",
    "  - env_vault.* and env_file.* carry the *name* of a secret or an",
    "    env key, never its value. A vault value crossing into params",
    "    would land in the JS heap — see rules/architecture.md, 'IPC",
    "    trust + secret direction'.",
    "  - board.* identifiers are user-controlled and pass through",
    "    board::error::redact_identifier before they reach an error, so",
    "    a token-shaped board or series name is masked, not echoed.",
    "  - board.sequence_replay names the writer as reported_writer.",
    "    boards.db has no IPC channel between its writers, so writer_id",
    "    is self-reported; the param name must not imply otherwise.",
    "    Every surface renders it as 'Reported by …'."
  ],
